title: A Hostile Long-Form Interview
subtitle: Reach beyond the Left bubble—or donate an hour of clips to its opponents.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_party_card
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_hostile_interview_card_timer <= 0 and (far_right_agenda >= 35 or republika_capacity >= 18 or kanal_zero_capacity >= 8 or pres_2020_active = 1 or (year = 2025 and month <= 6))
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_hostile_interview_card_timer = 3
card-image: img/poland/cards/hostile-interview.webp

= A Hostile Long-Form Interview

The host promises a “real conversation” about taxes, abortion, communism and
whether the Left is merely KO's difficult junior partner. The audience is large,
sceptical and reachable. Preparation will decide whether scepticism becomes
respect or ridicule.

- @take_interview
- @policy_format
- @walk_away

@take_interview
title: Take the interview on the host's terms
subtitle: Free. Existing media capacity determines whether confidence becomes competence.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.media_capacity >= 24) {
    Q.hostile_interview_success = 1;
    Q.left_poll += 0.5;
    Q.public_trust += 3;
    Q.media_capacity += 1;
    Q.media_access += 3;
    Q.winner_reputation += 3;
    Q.turnout_readiness += 2;
    Q.news_headline = "A hostile interview becomes an unlikely victory";
} else {
    Q.hostile_interview_success = 0;
    Q.left_poll -= 0.4;
    Q.public_trust -= 2;
    Q.winner_reputation -= 3;
    Q.leadership_authority -= 2;
    Q.party_unity -= 3;
    Q.barons_dissent += 2;
    Q.progressives_dissent += 2;
    Q.turnout_readiness -= 2;
    Q.news_headline = "One evasive answer becomes a week of hostile clips";
}
!}

[? if hostile_interview_success = 1: The spokesperson concedes uncertainty,
answers the difficult coalition question and keeps returning to material policy.
The audience does not become friendly, but competence travels beyond the Left's
bubble. ?]

[? if hostile_interview_success = 0: Nobody prepared the obvious follow-up.
Every faction sees a different betrayal in the answer, while the host publishes
six clips before headquarters agrees on one response. ?]

- #poland_card_finish

@policy_format
title: Insist on a costed policy interview
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Smaller audience, harder questions and fewer ambushes.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Preparing a policy format requires one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; media_capacity += 2; media_access += 2; winner_reputation += 2; issue_ownership += 2; labor_credibility += 3; progressive_credibility += 2; public_trust += 2; left_poll += 0.1; workers_support += 1; public_sector_support += 1; urban_progressive_support += 1; news_headline = "The hostile interview gets lost in the cost tables"

The host still interrupts, but every segment begins with a proposal and a
number. The clips are less spectacular and far more useful.

- #poland_card_finish

@walk_away
title: Refuse to legitimise the platform
subtitle: Protect organisers from a spectacle; surrender the audience and the framing.
on-arrival: public_trust -= 2; media_capacity -= 1; media_access -= 2; issue_ownership -= 1; far_right_agenda += 2; progressive_credibility += 1; progressives_dissent -= 1; barons_dissent += 2; party_unity += 1; young_support += 1; turnout_readiness -= 2; news_headline = "The empty chair receives almost as much airtime"

The refusal draws a clean moral line. The host spends the hour explaining what
the Left was afraid to answer, with nobody present to disagree.

- #poland_card_finish
